{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-tool-vision#feature-inspect","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"12b691d952dc02b28b606557d583be06394b656d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-vision 的功能「图片问答」：inspect_image 接收工作区路径或 HTTP(S) 图片地址，可附带具体问题和分辨率提示；它调用配置的视觉模型，并把文字回答返回给 DSH 对话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1243-1272"]}
{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-tool-vision#feature-bridge","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"12b691d952dc02b28b606557d583be06394b656d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-vision 的功能「图片桥接」：对不能直接接收图片的模型，插件可把会话图片整理成可持久化的文字提示，供 Agent 再调用 inspect_image 获取视觉描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1203-1239"]}
{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-tool-vision#feature-probe","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"12b691d952dc02b28b606557d583be06394b656d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-vision 的功能「模型能力探测」：vision_probe_model 向目标模型发送文字控制请求和两种纯色图片，核验端点能否读图，并记录判断供后续图片直发或桥接决策使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1292-1304"]}
{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-tool-vision#feature-tools","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"12b691d952dc02b28b606557d583be06394b656d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-vision 的功能「图像处理工具」：插件注册一组共享已配置视觉端点的图像工具，支持问答、OCR、定位与像素操作；图像输入会按统一像素预算缩小后再请求模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/vision-tools.js:1254-1271"]}
{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-tool-vision#feature-screenshot","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-tool-vision","commit":"12b691d952dc02b28b606557d583be06394b656d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-vision 的功能「桌面截图」：启用 desktopScreenshot 设置后，vision_screenshot 可捕获桌面为 PNG；可选地让配置的视觉模型识别截图并返回描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/vision-tools.js:2360-2368"]}
